  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sass/dart-sass/zipball/1.105.0",
  "body": "To install Sass 1.105.0, download one of the packages below and [add it to your PATH][], or see [the Sass website][] for full installation instructions.\n\n[add it to your PATH]: https://katiek2.github.io/path-doc/\n[the Sass website]: https://sass-lang.com/install\n\n# Changes\n\n* Add support for first-class modules. These can be accessed using the new `meta.load()` and `meta.get-module()` functions, and may be passed as the `$module` argument to numerous eisting `sass:meta` functions.\n\n* Add the `meta.css()` mixin, which includes CSS from a first-class module.\n\n### JS API\n\n* Add a `SassModule` class and a corresponding `Value.assertModule()` method.\n\n### Dart API\n\n* Add a `SassModule` class and a corresponding `Value.assertModule()` method.\n\nSee the [full changelog](https://github.com/sass/dart-sass/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#11050) for changes in earlier releases."
